To (@mengto). Views: 37; favorites: 15; remixes: 4.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, billing, navigation, links.\n## Overview\nNexuscore Unify Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nNexusCore Platform Solutions Pricing Company Dashboard Unify Your Data. Accelerate Growth. Streamline operations, synchronize your entire tech stack, and drive predictable revenue with a single source of truth built for…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Unify Your Data. Accelerate Growth..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF0B0B, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FF0B0B, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>NexusCore - Unify Your Data</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        accent: '#FF0B0B',\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Three.js for WebGL Background -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-black text-gray-200 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-accent/30 selection:text-white\" style=\"background-color: #000000;\">\n\n    <!-- Background Texture/Pattern -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-20\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Canvas Container -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-bg\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Framed Grid Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-[1400px] mx-auto min-h-screen flex flex-col border-x border-white/10\" style=\"border-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 100%) 1;\">\n\n        <!-- Corner Brackets -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"border-b border-white/10 py-5 px-6 md:px-12 flex justify-between items-center bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm relative\">\n            <div class=\"text-white text-lg tracking-tight font-medium\">\n                NexusCore\n            </div>\n\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex gap-10 text-sm font-normal text-gray-400\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Platform</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Solutions</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Pricing</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Company</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"bg-gray-100 hover:bg-white text-black text-xs font-medium px-4 py-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors duration-300 rounded-[2px]\">\n                Dashboard <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-accent text-sm\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow flex items-center px-6 md:px-12 pt-16 pb-32 relative\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-3xl relative z-10\">\n                <h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"text-4xl md:text-[3.5rem] leading-[1.1] text-white tracking-tighter mb-6 font-light\">\n                    Unify Your Data. Accelerate Growth.\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-xl mb-10 leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n                    Streamline operations, synchronize your entire tech stack, and drive predictable revenue with a single source of truth built for modern enterprise.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"bg-white text-black px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 rounded-[2px]\">\n                        Start Building\n                    </a>\n\n                    <!-- Button with subtle border gradient -->\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-all duration-300 rounded-[2px] group relative\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(#000, #000) padding-box, linear-gradient(to bottom right, rgba(255,255,255,0.3), rgba(255,255,255,0.05)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent;\">\n                        <span class=\"relative z-10 group-hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors\">Read Docs</span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Logic -->\n    <script>\n        // --- 1. Text Mask Reveal Animation (GSAP) ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        const titleElement = document.getElementById('hero-title');\n        const text = titleElement.innerText;\n        // Basic split by spaces\n        const words = text.split(' ');\n        titleElement.innerHTML = '';\n\n        words.forEach((word) => {\n            // Outer span for masking\n            const maskSpan = document.createElement('span');\n            maskSpan.style.display = 'inline-block';\n            maskSpan.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n            maskSpan.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n            maskSpan.style.marginRight = '0.25em';\n            maskSpan.style.paddingBottom = '0.1em'; // Prevent descender clipping\n\n            // Inner span to animate\n            const innerSpan = document.createElement('span');\n            innerSpan.className = 'reveal-word';\n            innerSpan.style.display = 'inline-block';\n            innerSpan.style.transform = 'translateY(110%)';\n            innerSpan.innerText = word;\n\n            maskSpan.appendChild(innerSpan);\n            titleElement.appendChild(maskSpan);\n        });\n\n        // Execute animation on load\n        window.addEventListener('load', () => {\n            gsap.to('.reveal-word', {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 0.85,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                ease: 'power3.out',\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n        });\n\n\n        // --- 2. WebGL Background Mesh (Three.js Custom Shader) ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-bg');\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: false });\n\n        // Handle resizing\n        function resize() {\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        }\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        resize();\n\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        // Orthographic camera for 2D full-screen shader effect\n        const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n\n        const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n\n        // Fragment Shader mimicking the noisy, stepped red gradient\n        const fragmentShader = `\n            uniform float u_time;\n            uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n\n            // Simple 2D noise pseudo-random generator\n            float random(vec2 st) {\n                return fract(sin(dot(st.xy, vec2(12.9898,78.233))) * 43758.5453123);\n            }\n\n            // Value Noise\n            float noise(vec2 st) {\n                vec2 i = floor(st);\n                vec2 f = fract(st);\n                float a = random(i);\n                float b = random(i + vec2(1.0, 0.0));\n                float c = random(i + vec2(0.0, 1.0));\n                float d = random(i + vec2(1.0, 1.0));\n                vec2 u = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n                return mix(a, b, u.x) + (c - a) * u.y * (1.0 - u.x) + (d - b) * u.x * u.y;\n            }\n\n            void main() {\n                vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n\n                // 1. Create stepped vertical columns (roughly 6 visible steps on right)\n                float columns = 7.0;\n                float colIndex = floor(uv.x * columns);\n\n                // Normalize colIndex for calculations\n                float nx = colIndex / columns;\n\n                // 2. Define the height curve for the red area (rises sharply to the right)\n                // Use a power function to keep the left side low and right side high\n                float baseHeight = pow(nx, 1.5) * 0.9;\n\n                // 3. Add dynamic noise to the edge of each column to break it up\n                // Time scales the noise movement\n                float n = noise(vec2(colIndex * 5.0, uv.y * 10.0 - u_time * 0.4));\n\n                // Calculate the noisy threshold boundary\n                float edge = baseHeight + (n * 0.2);\n\n                // 4. Create the grainy gradient fade\n                // Use random noise scaled by proximity to the edge to create the \"dithered\" look\n                float grain = random(uv * (u_time * 0.1 + 1.0));\n\n                // Smoothly interpolate across the edge boundary, adding grain to spread it\n                float intensity = smoothstep(edge + 0.15, edge - 0.25, uv.y + grain * 0.15);\n\n                // 5. Fade out completely towards the far left edge\n                intensity *= smoothstep(0.05, 0.3, uv.x);\n\n                // 6. Color Mapping\n                vec3 bgColor = vec3(0.0);\n                // Base red is dark, edge is bright vibrant red\n                vec3 darkRed = vec3(0.3, 0.0, 0.0);\n                vec3 brightRed = vec3(1.0, 0.05, 0.0); // Exact match for vibrant reference\n\n                // Mix colors based on vertical position within the masked area\n                float colorMix = smoothstep(0.0, edge, uv.y);\n                vec3 gradientColor = mix(darkRed, brightRed, colorMix);\n\n                vec3 finalColor = mix(bgColor, gradientColor, intensity);\n\n                gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor, 1.0);\n            }\n        `;\n\n        const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n            uniforms: {\n                u_time: { value: 0 },\n                u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2() }\n            },\n            vertexShader: `\n                void main() {\n                    gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0);\n                }\n            `,\n            fragmentShader: fragmentShader,\n            transparent: true\n        });\n\n        const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n        scene.add(mesh);\n\n        // Animation Loop\n        let clock = new THREE.Clock();\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            material.uniforms.u_time.value = clock.getElapsedTime();\n            material.uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n        animate();\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "nexuscore-unify-your-data.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexuscore-unify-your-data.jpg", "source_name": "nexuscore-unify-your-data-DESIGN.md", "views": 144, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T12:30:58.752247+00:00"}